# ⭐ OPIc Sample Answer - Day29

One activity I really enjoy doing in my free time is listening to music.

I usually listen to music when I'm relaxing at home or when I'm traveling somewhere.

The main reason is that music helps me reduce stress.

For example, when I have had a busy day, I often put on my favorite songs and just relax for a while.

Another reason is that music can change my mood.

If I'm tired, I listen to something energetic, and if I want to relax, I choose something calmer.

That's why listening to music has become an important part of my daily life.
